[6.1.1]
* Refresh the job search workspace and resume builder with the Calm interface and phone layouts.
* Add custom CSS for public resume pages, separate from PDF styling.
* Preserve guest application workspaces, saved preparation and practice transcripts when linking accounts.
* Fix localized date editing, Georgian PDF text, uploaded pictures and Word export headers.
* Recheck practice stories after their supporting facts change.
* Add optional font mirroring and assistant timeout settings; allow keyless OpenAI-compatible providers.
* Apply a startup index migration. Application Trash expires after 30 days; existing items are kept until at least December 31, 2026 UTC.

[6.1.0]
* Apply with a private profile, reviewed answers and application packets; fill supported employer forms from the desktop browser helper.
* Save job postings from the browser helper or the mobile share sheet.
* Add feedback links for coaches and reviewers, resume language copies, keyboard shortcuts and application Trash.
* Add optional fast and capable AI models per connection and a weekly AI usage report.
* Improve PDF and Word imports, Indic, Ethiopic and Khmer PDF fonts, and right-to-left public pages.
* Include uploaded files and version history in account backups.
* Default new API keys to read-only.
* Apply 23 additive startup migrations. Back up the database before upgrading. No new environment variables.
* Complete web and mobile translations.

[6.0.8]
* Add entry header layouts, row order and accent controls across resume templates.
* Add custom application stages with names, colors, ordering and preserved application history.
* Add shareable resume pages and custom-domain controls, including available .cv suggestions.
* Speed up application lists and public pages; fix alias loading, share links and sign-in layouts.
* Harden sign-in, assistant approvals, document access, imports and exports.
* Require STARTTLS or direct TLS for SMTP. Reconfigure plaintext-only mail servers before upgrading.
* Apply startup migrations for resume sharing, application stages and username reservations. Back up the database before upgrading.
* Complete web and mobile translations.

[6.0.6]
* Refresh the visual design with the original colors, new typefaces and clearer interface copy.
* Speed up browsing with cached thumbnails and on-demand PDF viewer loading.
* Link the iOS and Android apps from the homepage.
* Prevent edits to resumes in Trash.
* Clean up read notifications older than 90 days. No migrations or configuration changes.
* Complete web and mobile translations.

[6.0.5]
* Preserve guest photos and attachments when signing up or linking an account.
* Add search-country preferences and optional direct SearXNG search.
* Repair renamed public resume links, PDF text imports and page backgrounds.
* Improve mobile navigation, sign-in, refresh feedback and PDF zoom controls.
* Harden authentication, document access, imports and outbound requests.
* Apply startup migrations for username reservations, Trash cleanup indexes and deleted conversation messages. Back up the database before upgrading; Trash items older than 30 days are now deleted.
* Reject example secrets in production and require AUTH_SECRET to contain at least 32 characters. Keep valid existing secrets unchanged.
* Complete web and mobile translations.

[6.0.4]
* Add the Persian resume template and improve CJK previews on slow connections.
* Complete web and mobile translations across all supported translation locales.
* Protect share passwords on locked resumes and allow slower storage health checks.
* Add native-client sign-in and content-reporting support.
* Support Computer Modern font mirrors for server-side PDF rendering.

[6.0.3]
* Initial release
